    "directions": [
      "In a bowl, season chicken with salt, pepper, curry powder, paprika, and all-purpose. Add onion, garlic, ginger, spring onion, scotch bonnet, and thyme. Massage everything together well.",
      "Heat coconut oil in a pan on medium heat. Brown the seasoned chicken for 10 minutes, stirring occasionally.",
      "Pour in chicken stock and water. Cover and simmer for 20 minutes on medium-low heat. Add the diced carrots and potatoes about 7–8 minutes before the end of cooking time.",
      "Simmer until everything is tender and the sauce has thickened.",
      "Grate cauliflower florets or blitz in a food processor until fine. Wash and drain thoroughly.",
      "In a large pan, heat olive oil over medium heat. Add the cauliflower rice and sauté for 3–5 minutes.",
      "Season with salt, pepper, garlic powder, all-purpose, and dried thyme. Pour in coconut milk, stir well, and cook for another 3–4 minutes until soft and creamy."
    ],
